# Vercel
.vercel

# Design references, not app assets. 162 MB between them in this app alone, and
# they sit in the Vite public directory — so every build copies them into dist/
# and a deploy would publish the entire design archive. The customer app has
# carried this rule since its own deploy prep; this one did not, and a
# `git add frontend/admin` staged all of it.
#
# They stay on the machines that have them. Nothing the dashboard renders should
# ever come from here — its images arrive from Cloudinary through the API.
public/RajdhaniWebsiteReferenceImages/
public/RajdhaniPagesRequireImages/
